{
    "title": "Extreme Car Drifting: Car Game",
    "description": "In this extreme car drifting game you can will do driving and drifting in stylish luxury cars. You\u2019ll even have a friendly dog companion with your character. When you start the open world mode, you\u2019ll see a wide range of high-end cars and various breeds of dogs and cats. Choose your favorite dog or cat and than pick your luxury car and get ready for an adrenaline-pumping experience. In this extreme car drifting game, you\u2019ll explore a open world environment filled with exciting missions like Speed through checkpoints, mega ramps, extreme car drifting missions. A cool mobile phone feature lets you call your favorite car, dog and cat to your location anytime, so you\u2019re always ready for real car driving. While driving, use the car jump button to leap over traffic and obstacles, Keep your car in top shape by refueling and fixing it when needed. Avoid crashes to keep your driving smooth and enjoy the thrill of extreme car drifting. Whether you\u2019re a fan of real car games or just love car drifting games, this one has it all!",
    "descriptionHTML": "In this extreme car drifting game you can will do driving and drifting in stylish luxury cars. You\u2019ll even have a friendly dog companion with your character. When you start the open world mode, you\u2019ll see a wide range of high-end cars and various breeds of dogs and cats. Choose your favorite dog or cat and than pick your luxury car and get ready for an adrenaline-pumping experience. In this extreme car drifting game, you\u2019ll explore a open world environment filled with exciting missions like Speed through checkpoints, mega ramps, extreme car drifting missions. A cool mobile phone feature lets you call your favorite car, dog and cat to your location anytime, so you\u2019re always ready for real car driving. While driving, use the car jump button to leap over traffic and obstacles, Keep your car in top shape by refueling and fixing it when needed. Avoid crashes to keep your driving smooth and enjoy the thrill of extreme car drifting. Whether you\u2019re a fan of real car games or just love car drifting games, this one has it all!",
